Records the two lossy modes observed while delivering the equivalent-lambertian
patch (receiver-side tab/whitespace mangling of plain patches; sender-side
character slips in long base64 pastes, incl. silent ones), with the evidence
commits (b708ea6, 11a774d, f65f439, 39e3635), and the chunked-base64 +
per-chunk sha256 protocol to use while git push is unavailable.
